<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.seal.keeps ~ the founding-kahu roster and its pre-rotated charter-epoch chain

`lares nexus seal <sub>` keeps the Nexus seal, the quorum that governs carriage membership, the antigen and its own succession. `seat` gives each persona that stood for a chair a seat key of its own and establishes the genesis epoch, each chair's next key printed once on a cold-key card the operator types back (`--threshold <k>`); `rotate` takes the cards back and advances the chain, failing closed on a roll the law refuses; `show` reads the roster, chain head and quorum verdict; `export` and `import <file>` carry a charter (`--carry` lands a partner's beside yours); `grow` and `cold rehearse` read cards against the committed digests (`--note` marks a witness); `cofound open|join|seal` founds a fresh two-of-two Nexus with a second operator (`--release`, `--charter-law`, `--heard`, `--heard-threshold`, `--out`, `--face`); `roll open|join|sign|file|abandon` rolls a joint Nexus across vaults (`--added`, `--cold-key` on a staged test root, `--index`); `anchor` signs a two-vault roll's anchor (`--edge`, `--from`, `--out`). A cold-key card rides a terminal alone.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ show · seat · import-carry

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`show` params=`sub/show ~ read the roster and chain head`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`seat` params=`sub/seat threshold/2 ~ seat the chairs at two of three`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`import-carry` params=`sub/import file/partner-charter.json carry/true ~ land a partner's charter beside yours`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ sub · file · threshold · cold-key · index · note · carry · heard · heard-threshold · charter-law · release · added · nexus · edge · from · out · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sub` params=`takes/word needs/required seat/1 as/<seat|rotate|show|export|import|grow|cold|cofound|roll|anchor> ~ the seal act`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/words seat/2 as/<args…> ~ the act's own words: a file, an offer, a sub-step`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`threshold` params=`takes/count ~ the quorum rule; default, a majority of those that stood`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`cold-key` params=`takes/card ~ stands in for the terminal on a staged test root alone`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`index` params=`takes/handle-index ~ the face whose seat acts`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`note` params=`takes/words ~ a witness mark's note`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`carry` params=`~ import a partner's charter beside yours under its AID`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`heard` params=`takes/list ~ the seat fingerprints as heard`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`heard-threshold` params=`takes/count ~ the rule as heard`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`charter-law` params=`takes/uri ~ the charter law a cofounding names`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`release` params=`takes/uri ~ the release manifest record a cofounding names`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`added` params=`takes/chair ~ a chair a roll adds`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus, by AID; absent, the primary charter's`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`edge` params=`~ sign the realm edge anchors of the roll`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`from` params=`takes/host-path ~ judge a carried partial before any signature`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ write the offer, join or partial file`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ the face whose seat signs`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

