!! refuses ~ usage · refused · rotation-unarmed · not-found · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.seal.keeps sub/show]] ~ an unknown sub-verb, a torn charter, a chain already rotated past genesis, or no card typed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`refused` params=`~ the ceremony refused by name; nothing moved`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`rotation-unarmed` params=`~ the head committed no next key set this vault holds`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`not-found` params=`~ the named charter or partial stands nowhere`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

